   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nature and Health &#x2013; Good Future</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Nature and Health &#x2013; Good Future</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Mikrogrant je zameran&#xfd; na dobudovanie infra&#x161;trukt&#xfa;ry v lesoparku v meste Ro&#x17e;aje (most pre pe&#x161;&#xed;ch, rampa pre &#x13e;ud&#xed; so zdravotn&#xfd;m znev&#xfd;hodnen&#xed;m, lavi&#x10d;ky, ko&#x161;e, at&#x10f;.) a v&#xfd;sadbu 100 ks stromov. V r&#xe1;mci projektu bude tie&#x17e; pripraven&#xfd; dokument&#xe1;rny film o neleg&#xe1;lnych skl&#xe1;dkach v okol&#xed;, ako s&#xfa;&#x10d;as&#x165; osvety pre verejnos&#x165;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is focused on completing the infrastructure in the forest park in the town of Ro&#x17e;aje (pedestrian bridge, ramp for people with disabilities, benches, baskets, etc.) and planting 100 trees. The project will also support the production of a documentary movie about illegal landfills in the area, as part of public awareness.</narrative>
  </description>
